; ============================================================================
; wpms_housekeeping.pfasm — the BG window of the housekeeping (HK) Stay that
; closes every sweep. Deliverable 3 §6.2.
; Every block is inside its write window here (its latch this sweep is past,
; its next latch is in the next sweep), so the GO's items land whole.
; BCP copies the take-set latched at this sweep's strobe: masked slots and
; RT.OUT into the block store, the sweep item into SWEEP.a (EW5-checked),
; then raises inbox-taken (CR5-I3). After HK the sequencer prefetches the
; next sweep's first bundle and Stay value.
; License: MIT (Layer 3). Illustrative.
; ============================================================================
.window wpms_housekeeping
.bg
        BCP
